    "content" : "Quality Services and Supports"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 406.8, 284.916, 736.478, 356.724 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Quality is a fundamental consideration in the provision of services and supports. People receiving services and their families deserve the highest quality and they must be assured that quality is continually measured by people who are knowledgeable, trained and independent."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 11,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 406.8, 192.996, 715.687, 274.956 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Quality means: Maintaining health and safety… Achieving optimal service outcomes for people… Providing to consumers and families value for the dollar."
